<section class="section section--white" aria-labelledby="s1-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split">
      <div class="split__aside">
        <h2 class="split__title rv" id="s1-title">Web Application Security Testing to Protect Business Data</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="split__body prose">
        <p class="rv">Web app security testing services involve evaluating websites and web applications to identify vulnerabilities that could expose sensitive data, compromise user accounts or disrupt business operations. These services help organizations understand how securely their applications handle user access, process information and protect against common cyber threats.</p>
        <p class="rv">CipherTrivia provides web app security testing services that combine automated security tools with manual testing to identify weaknesses in authentication, access controls, input validation, application logic and data protection. Our web application penetration testing evaluates how identified vulnerabilities could be exploited through controlled attack simulations, helping businesses understand potential risks and their impact.</p>
        <p class="rv">As a web app security testing company, CipherTrivia delivers detailed security reports with validated findings, risk ratings and practical remediation recommendations. This helps development teams fix vulnerabilities, strengthen application security and improve protection against threats such as SQL injection, cross-site scripting (XSS), broken access controls and unauthorized data access.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

