<section class="section section--stone" aria-labelledby="s4-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="shead">
      <div class="shead__meta"></div>
      <div class="shead__body">
        <h2 class="shead__title rv" id="s4-title">Common Web Application Vulnerabilities Our Security Testing Identifies</h2>
        <p class="shead__lede rv" style="--d:1">CipherTrivia provides web app security testing services to help businesses identify security weaknesses that could put websites, customer information and business operations at risk. Our web application security testing helps uncover vulnerabilities that attackers may exploit to access sensitive data, misuse application features or disrupt services. We provide clear findings and practical recommendations to help businesses improve application security and protect their digital assets.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="triggers">
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("db-in", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">SQL Injection</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">We check how web applications handle user input to identify weaknesses that could allow unauthorized access to databases. Fixing these vulnerabilities helps protect customer records, login details and confidential business information.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("browser", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Cross-Site Scripting (XSS)</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">We identify weaknesses that could allow harmful scripts to run in a visitor's browser. Addressing these issues helps protect user accounts, website visitors and sensitive information from potential misuse.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("unlock", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Broken Access Controls</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">We check if users can access pages, records or features that should be restricted. Our testing helps prevent unauthorized access to customer data, employee information and administrative functions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("key", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Login &amp; Account Security Issues</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">We assess login processes, password controls and user sessions to identify weaknesses that could put accounts at risk. This helps businesses strengthen user authentication and account protection.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("cursor", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Unauthorized Actions &amp; Request Forgery</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">We check whether an attacker could trick a logged-in user into performing an unintended action. This helps protect important account changes, customer settings and sensitive transactions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("gear", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Web Application Security Misconfigurations</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">We review application settings and security controls to identify errors that could expose sensitive information or create opportunities for attacks. Correcting these issues helps improve website security and application protection.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("server", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Unsafe Server Requests</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">We identify weaknesses in application features that connect to other websites or internal systems. These issues could allow unauthorized requests to reach resources that should remain protected.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("database", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Sensitive Data Exposure</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">We assess how web applications handle personal information, account details and business records to identify risks involving data storage, transmission or access. Our recommendations help improve data protection and information security.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("update", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Insecure File Uploads</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">We review file upload features to identify weaknesses that could allow unsafe files to be uploaded or accessed improperly. This helps protect web servers, application files and stored business data.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("container", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Outdated Software &amp; Components</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">We check for outdated frameworks, libraries and software components that may contain known security vulnerabilities. Addressing these issues helps reduce exposure to known cyber threats and application attacks.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

