          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="deliver__item rv">
          {{ icon("gauge") }}
          <div>
            <h3 class="deliver__title">Vulnerability Severity &amp; Risk Assessment</h3>
            <p class="deliver__text">We classify identified vulnerabilities based on their severity and potential business impact. This helps your team distinguish critical security issues from lower-risk findings and prioritize remediation based on the level of exposure.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="deliver__item rv">
          {{ icon("magnifier") }}
          <div>
            <h3 class="deliver__title">Evidence-Based Vulnerability Findings</h3>
            <p class="deliver__text">Our security experts provide supporting evidence for identified weaknesses along with details of affected URLs, application functions and vulnerable components where applicable. These findings help development teams understand the issue and validate the security gaps.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="deliver__item rv">
          {{ icon("wrench") }}
          <div>
            <h3 class="deliver__title">Actionable Remediation Recommendations</h3>
            <p class="deliver__text">We provide practical recommendations to address identified vulnerabilities, improve security controls and reduce the risk of exploitation. Our guidance helps developers understand the corrective measures required for issues involving authentication, access controls, input validation and data protection.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="deliver__item rv">
          {{ icon("shield-crack") }}
          <div>
            <h3 class="deliver__title">Web Application Penetration Testing Results</h3>
            <p class="deliver__text">Our web application penetration testing evaluates how identified weaknesses could be exploited through controlled testing. We document validated attack scenarios and their potential impact to help your team understand the actual security implications.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="deliver__item rv">
          {{ icon("shield-check") }}
          <div>
            <h3 class="deliver__title">Retesting &amp; Fix Verification</h3>
            <p class="deliver__text">When included in the agreed scope, we retest resolved vulnerabilities to verify whether corrective measures have addressed the original findings. We also document the retesting status and highlight any remaining issues that require further attention.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="deliver__item rv">
          {{ icon("chart") }}
          <div>
            <h3 class="deliver__title">Security Improvement Priorities</h3>
            <p class="deliver__text">We summarize key findings and recommend next steps to help your organization plan security improvements. This gives technical teams and decision-makers a clearer view of application risks and the actions needed to strengthen protection.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
